红/金辉/粉紫)、嗅觉(草木/面包甜香)、听觉、触觉\n2. 比喻精彩：「像洒了一路的星子」「像被揉碎的胭脂」\n3. 首尾呼应，结构完整\n4. 立意温情：慢下来发现平凡中的美","type":"text"}],"问题与建议":[{"text":"1. 第4段心理转变略快，建议加一句铺垫\n2. 「晕染」出现两次，可换词\n3. 结尾感悟前面蓄力不够，力量感稍弱","type":"text"}],"题材":"散文"},"record_id":"recvfgi1qS9nTS"}],"has_more":false,"total":1},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774791673527}}
{"type":"message","id":"b6f8bcab","parentId":"57137197","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:41:29.651Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The second image is another essay titled \"那一刻，我读懂了时光里的温柔共生\". This is a beautiful essay about the author visiting the Wuyi Lane (乌衣巷) in Nanjing and understanding the coexistence of historical grandeur and everyday life. Let me analyze it and then upload it to the table.\n\nKey observations:\n- Title: 《那一刻，我读懂了时光里的温柔共生》\n- Genre: 散文 (散文)\n- Theme: 历史与平凡的共生，乌衣巷的个人感悟\n- Writing quality: Excellent - philosophical, descriptive, well-structured\n\nLet me upload the image and create a record for this second essay.","thinkingSignature":"691a98c935c544997181fb8064572b37687d51274422f711faae2e80a4900039"},{"type":"text","text":"第二篇识别到了——《那一刻，我读懂了时光里的温柔共生》🌸 马上录入！\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_8adwzesl3moe_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cp /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/7111103e-e005-43fa-9ac7-bc5b02c721e9.jpg /tmp/essay_xixi_002.jpg\n\nACCESS_TOKEN=$(security find-generic-password -s \"openclaw-feishu-uat\" \\\n  -a \"cli_a93534f5edb85bd3:ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\" -w 2>/dev/null | python3 -c \\\n  \"import sys,json; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print(d.get('accessToken',''))\")\n\nFILE_SIZE=$(stat -f%z /tmp/essay_xixi_002.jpg 2>/dev/null || stat -c%s /tmp/essay_xixi_002.jpg 2>/dev/null)\n\nRESULT=$(curl -s -X POST \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/files/upload_all\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $ACCESS_TOKEN\" \\\n  -F \"file_name=essay_xixi_002.jpg\" \\\n  -F \"parent_type=bitable_image\" \\\n  -F \"parent_node=TAxUbXUmKaXVuXsNWOacbP1Tne1\" \\\n  -F \"size=$FILE_SIZE\" \\\n  -F \"file=@/tmp/essay_xixi_002.jpg;type=image/jpeg\" \\\n  -F 'extra={\"bitablePerm\":{\"tableId\":\"tbldVtgigav27nJZ\"}}')\n\necho \"$RESULT\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":16346,"output":512,"cacheRead":30974,"cacheWrite":0,"total