{"type":"message","id":"0a1c79c9","parentId":"612d83b6","timestamp":"2026-03-29T13:41:49.003Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Second essay has been added successfully. Now let me summarize for the user.","thinkingSignature":"43cb03d7d356e560b4b141e861766e2b919a8caeb3cad309df09b7b4091686f4"},{"type":"text","text":"录入完成 ✅\n\n**第二篇：《那一刻，我读懂了时光里的温柔共生》**\n\n| 项目 | 内容 |\n|------|------|\n| 评分 | ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ |\n| 题材 | 散文 |\n| 亮点 | 乌衣巷取材独特、意象丰富、哲理升华自然、通感运用精彩 |\n| 建议 | 结尾说理可更含蓄；部分形容词可再打磨 |\n\n两篇都在作文集里了：\n\n1. 《让归途充满味道》 ⭐⭐⭐⭐\n2. 《那一刻，我读懂了时光里的温柔共生》 ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\n兮兮这两篇散文都写得很有质感，尤其是第二篇立意很成熟👍"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":17524,"output":164,"cacheRead":30974,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48662,"cost":{"input":0.0052572,"output":0.00019679999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0018584399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00731244}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774791702920,"responseId":"06185f1721929dd0cd56b88b287eddb5"}}
